---
kind: scene
id: spine.plateau
title: The Summit Plateau
on: enterPlace
target: place.summitPlateau
once: false
---

## The gate

::bg{location="summit-plateau" time="day"}
::actor{character="gatekeeper" anchor="center" action="enter"}
<match>
  <when test="@badgeCount >= 8">
    @gatekeeper{code="0010"}: Eight badges. The Summit League is ready for you. Beyond this door are the Elite Four, and past them, the Champion.
    @gatekeeper{code="0020"}: Once you step through, there is no leaving until you win or lose. Good luck.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @gatekeeper{code="0030"}: Only trainers with all eight of Verdane's badges may challenge the League. You have {{@badgeCount}}.
  </otherwise>
</match>
